---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/urls';
import { products, checkedDate } from '../data/shop';
---
<Layout title="Good clothes. Second chances." description="Afterglow Vintage. A 90s state of mind, reimagined for now. Explore the edit, find your next favorite, and shop vintage on Depop.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A 90s STATE OF MIND</p><h1>Nothing new.<br /><em>Everything you.</em></h1></div>
    <div class="hero-frame"><img class="hero-image" src={url('images/hero.webp')} width="1536" height="1024" alt="90s-inspired editorial: oversized brown leather, faded denim, and late afternoon light" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="hero-image-shade"></div><div class="hero-caption"><span>THE AFTERGLOW EDIT</span><span>VOL. 01 — STILL IN ROTATION</span></div><span class="hero-seal" aria-hidden="true">OLD SOUL<br /><b>✳</b><br />NEW ENERGY</span></div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><p>For the pieces with a past.<br />And the people who make them their own.</p><a class="button" href={url('shop/')}>Find your next favorite <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link hero-scroll" href="#the-edit">TAKE A LOOK ↓</a></div>
  </section>
  <div class="ticker" aria-label="Good clothes never go out of style"><div aria-hidden="true"><span>GOOD CLOTHES NEVER GET OLD</span> ✳ <span>1996 ATTITUDE. 2026 EXECUTION.</span> ✳ <span>GOOD CLOTHES NEVER GET OLD</span> ✳ <span>1996 ATTITUDE. 2026 EXECUTION.</span> ✳</div></div>
  <section id="the-edit" class="section edit-section">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">001 / THE MOODBOARD</p><h2>Back then.<br /><em>Right now.</em></h2></div><p>A little thrift-store serendipity.<br />A little main-character energy.<br />No rules about the decade.</p></div>
    <div class="edit-grid">
      <a class="edit-card edit-card-photo" href={url('lookbook/#off-duty')} data-reveal><div class="image-wrap"><img src={url('images/hero.webp')} width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="Brown leather and faded denim styling inspiration" /><span class="image-index">01</span><span class="round-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="card-caption"><h3>The off-duty uniform</h3><span>LEATHER / DENIM / REPEAT</span></div></a>
      <a class="edit-card edit-card-photo edit-card-offset" href={url('lookbook/#in-the-details')} data-reveal><div class="image-wrap"><img src={url('images/editorial.webp')} width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="Denim, leather, and sunglasses arranged in warm sunlight" /><span class="image-index">02</span><span class="round-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="card-caption"><h3>It's in the details</h3><span>TEXTURE / PATINA / PERSONALITY</span></div></a>
    </div>
    <p class="image-note">Editorial imagery for inspiration. Explore the shop for available pieces.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section featured-section"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">002 / FROM THE SHOP</p><h2>Found it.<br /><em>Love it. Wear it.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={url('shop/')}>ALL FEATURED PIECES ↗</a></div><div class="product-grid">{[products[0], products[3], products[4]].map(product => <a class="product-card" href={product.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src={url(product.image)} width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" alt={product.name} /><span class="eyebrow">{product.category} / SIZE {product.size}</span><h3>{product.name}</h3><p>{product.price} USD <span>Check on Depop ↗</span></p></a>)}</div><p class="image-note">Depop listings checked {checkedDate}. See Depop for current prices and availability.</p></section>
  <section class="manifesto section" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">SOME THINGS AGE BETTER.</p><h2>Good denim.<br />Great records.<br /><em>Your sense of style.</em></h2><div class="manifesto-bottom"><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>We’re here for clothes with character. The worn-in, the unexpected, the “where did you find that?” Vintage with a life before yours. Ready for whatever comes next.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('about/')}>A LITTLE ABOUT AFTERGLOW ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="shop-invite section"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR OWN AFTERGLOW</p><h2>Your next favorite<br /><em>has a history.</em></h2><a class="button button-light" href={url('shop/')}>Step into the shop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="shop-invite-mark" aria-hidden="true">a<span>✳</span></div></section>
</Layout>
